# HRL-VGAE: Hierarchical Reinforcement Learning with VGAE for Multi-Objective SFC Deployment

Code Freeze Baseline: `v1.0-freeze`

## 1. Directory Structure
```text
├── config.py                  # Hyperparameters & network/MOO/reward configs
├── train.py                   # HRL-VGAE training & validation/checkpointing
├── evaluate.py                # AR/Cost evaluation, Pareto scan, HV/R2/IGD+
├── pretrain_vgae.py           # Optional static VGAE pre-training
├── run_kaggle_experiments.py  # Experiment runner, manifests, multi-seed, cross-MO
├── agents/                    # HLAgent & LLAgent (preference-conditioned Q-learning)
├── models/                    # MNVGAE, HLSharedQScorer, LLNodeScorer
├── env/                       # NFVEnvironment & timeline resource manager
├── data/                      # Dataset loader & episode generators
├── utils/                     # Graph features, Dijkstra, Pareto indicators, stats_agg, logger
├── scripts/
│   ├── plot_results.py        # Training/screening/Pareto/comparative plotting
│   └── generate_report.py     # Automated CSV/LaTeX/Markdown/figure report builder
└── tests/                     # Regression, framework, and reporting test suites

2. Environment & Dependency Check

Install dependencies (on Kaggle, keep pre-installed CUDA torch and install
missing packages only):

pip install -r requirements.txt
python run_kaggle_experiments.py --check-env

3. Dataset Preparation

Place testcase topologies ({topology}_{allocation}_{difficulty}.json) under
data/testcase/ (or /kaggle/input/**/testcase on Kaggle). Shared test episodes
are auto-generated once per (topology, allocation, difficulty) via
data/generate_episodes.py using --test-seed.

4. VGAE Pre-training (Optional)

python pretrain_vgae.py --episode data/testcase/nsf_centers_hard.json --epochs 100 --out checkpoints/pretrained_vgae.pt

5. Training & Ablations

Supported --ablation modes: HRL-VGAE, HRL-noVGAE, GreedyLowLevel, GreedyFIFO,
Random-Fit, DefaultBaseline.

python train.py \
  --train-file data/testcase/nsf_centers_hard.json \
  --ablation HRL-VGAE --seed 42 --epochs 10 \
  --checkpoint checkpoints/nsf_centers_hard.pt \
  --csv logs/nsf_centers_hard.csv

6. Evaluation, Pareto Scan & Indicators

python evaluate.py --ar-cost-only \
  --checkpoint checkpoints/nsf_centers_hard.pt \
  --data-dir data/test/nsf/centers/hard --max-episodes 10 \
  --ar-cost-out results/nsf_centers_hard/screen_ar_cost.json --ablation HRL-VGAE

python evaluate.py --pareto-scan \
  --checkpoint checkpoints/nsf_centers_hard.pt \
  --single-episode data/test/nsf/centers/hard/episode_0000.json \
  --pareto-points 11 --pareto-out results/nsf_centers_hard/pareto_front.json \
  --compute-hv --hv-out results/nsf_centers_hard/hv_result.json --ablation HRL-VGAE

7. Kaggle T4x2 Multi-Seed / Cross-Ablation Pipeline & Resume

python run_kaggle_experiments.py \
  --topology nsf --allocation centers --difficulty hard \
  --ablation HRL-VGAE --seeds 42 43 44 --test-seed 42 \
  --epochs 10 --time-budget-hours 11.5

python run_kaggle_experiments.py \
  --topology nsf --allocation centers --difficulty hard \
  --ablation HRL-noVGAE --seeds 42 43 44 --test-seed 42 --epochs 10 \
  --compute-cross-mo --cross-mo-ablations HRL-VGAE HRL-noVGAE DefaultBaseline --aggregate

